  "message": "We have a few tools the team uses. Four “mappers” look for vendor patterns by payment type—cash, card, bank transfers and other methods. The synthesizer pulls those mapper reports together and flags missed bills, odd amounts and new recurring candidates. The receipt scanner hunts for orphaned or mis‑labelled receipt images, and the expense reconciler finds expense rows without matching receipts. Finally, the progress checker can tell you which reports are already generated and how fresh they are.",
